            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "gvlIO",
              "name": "textCol",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 22,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "yslgw",
                  "fill": "#1B1A17",
                  "content": "Hi, I'm Jordan.",
                  "fontFamily": "Schibsted Grotesk",
                  "fontSize": 30,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "s2fBZf",
                  "fill": "#6E675C",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "I'm a full-time CTO (with Run for Something), a consulting fractional CTO (most recently for LingroLearning), and consistently just one post away from being what I'd consider a writer. More importantly, I'm a dad in Minneapolis who loves history, good coffee, and building things on my computer. In a good week, you can catch me exploring all three with my hobby project, Historio.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.62,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 17,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "k2tZx",
          "name": "Work With Me",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "stroke": "#E7E0D2",
          "strokeWidth": {
            "top": 1,
            "bottom": 1
          },
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 22,
          "padding": [
            92,
            112
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "DkT6y",
              "fill": "#A8481F",
              "content": "LET'S SOLVE A PROBLEM TOGETHER",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "600",
              "letterSpacing": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "M2x3T",
              "fill": "#6E675C",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 760,
              "content": "My capacity to take on consulting work is very limited (see above RE kids). That said, I have a hard time saying no using novel tech to solve the right challenge with the right people.\n\nThe right challenges include:\n- How to get the right people elected to public office\n- How to empower local leaders to better serve their communities\n- How to each kids technical things\n- How to better connect histories, and apply them to the present\n\nThe right people include: Collaborative creatives with a clear sense of how their impact will better others.",
              "lineHeight": 1.62,
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 17,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
